      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. everything just feels so fake lately. like i'm looking at the world through a thick piece of glass or something. i see people laughing and worrying about stupid stuff and i just don't get it anymore. it's like i'm not even really part of this anymore. just a ghost walking around.",
