    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"fog\" though. it's deeper. i spent years in places where everything actually mattered, where life and death were real. now i'm back and everything is just... shallow. like everyone is playing pretend in a world that doesn't even deserve the effort. sometimes i feel like i already died back there and i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
